{"id":"9df1aa443914fe25","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Filter Of Poset","display":"df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset — ZFC Order11 Filter Of Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset — ZFC Order11 Filter Of Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-filter-of-poset — ZFC Order11 Filter Of Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(F,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}filter\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(F,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land F\\subseteq P\\land F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to y\\in F)\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\exists z\\in F\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}filter\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11FilterOfPoset}_S(F,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land F\\subseteq P\\land F\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall x\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to y\\in F)\\land\\forall x,y\\in F\\;\\exists z\\in F\\;(\\langle z,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle z,y\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary filter definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","sta